<title>USA: Franklin Ophthalmic Q1 boosted by gain.</title>
<headline>Franklin Ophthalmic Q1 boosted by gain.</headline>
<dateline>ROMEOVILLE, Ill. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Ophthalmic Instruments Co Inc said Thursday an extraordinary gain of $2.9 million from debt restructuring enabled the company to post net income for the December 31 first quarter of $2.8 million</p>
<p>In the same year-earlier period it recorded a loss of $419,665.</p>
<p>Franklin sells and services instrumentation used by opthalmologists, optometrists and medical organizations.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
